title: NeedsAndWants_Start
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action open_aarav_stall>>
aarav: Bro. Bro. Look at this. Wireless buds. Original.
aarav: For you — thirty. Real thing. Not a knockoff.
<<player_choose>>
-> Show me.
    aarav: Look at the box. See the logo. Pure.
    <<jump NeedsAndWants_Inspect>>
-> Thirty? Out of my Spend envelope?
    aarav: Thirty is nothing for sound like this.
    <<jump NeedsAndWants_Inspect>>
===

title: NeedsAndWants_Inspect
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action inspect_airpod_box>>
aarav: Don't look so close. Just buy.
maya-didi: (whispers) Before you spend thirty, do one thing.
maya-didi: Open your notebook. Two columns. Needs. Wants.
<<wait_for_action open_notebook>>
maya-didi: Drag every line from today into the right column.
maya-didi: Rule of thumb. If you skip it, do you still survive the week?
<<jump NeedsAndWants_Sort>>
===

title: NeedsAndWants_Sort
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action drag_item rent needs>>
<<wait_for_action drag_item dabba_lunch needs>>
<<wait_for_action drag_item bus_pass needs>>
<<wait_for_action drag_item chai needs>>
<<wait_for_action drag_item airpod_copy wants>>
<<wait_for_action drag_item movie_ticket wants>>
maya-didi: Look at the Wants column. Add it up.
maya-didi: Thirty-two in one day. Your Spend envelope is eight hundred and twenty.
<<player_choose>>
-> Buy the buds anyway.
    aarav: Yes. The king has arrived.
    <<wait_for_action hand_over_cash 30>>
    maya-didi: Your choice. Watch the envelope.
    <<set_flag bought_fake_airpods>>
    <<jump NeedsAndWants_Aftermath>>
-> Walk away from the stall.
    aarav: Tomorrow then. Tomorrow with a discount.
    maya-didi: You looked at the column and decided. That is the skill.
    <<set_flag refused_fake_airpods>>
    <<jump NeedsAndWants_Aftermath>>
-> Negotiate to $5.
    aarav: Five? The box alone costs five.
    aarav: Fifteen. Final. Pinky promise.
    <<player_choose>>
    -> Still no.
        <<set_flag refused_fake_airpods>>
        <<jump NeedsAndWants_Aftermath>>
    -> Done. Fifteen.
        <<wait_for_action hand_over_cash 15>>
        <<set_flag bought_fake_airpods>>
        <<jump NeedsAndWants_Aftermath>>
===

title: NeedsAndWants_Aftermath
tags:
---
maya-didi: Two columns. Every coin. Every day.
maya-didi: Wants are not bad. Wants without a column are.
<<continue>>
